  "notes": "{歌|うた} means song or (in classical contexts) poem/verse.\n\nSENSE 1 - SONG:\n- {歌|うた}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{歌|うた}う→歌う：00684_utau⟧: to sing a song\n- {歌|うた}⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{上手|じょうず}→上手：00707_jouzu⟧: good at singing\n- ⟦{好|す}きな→好き：02355_suki⟧{歌|うた}: favorite song\n\nSENSE 2 - POETRY:\nRefers to traditional Japanese verse forms:\n- ⟦{和歌|わか}→和歌：05230_waka⟧: waka (31-syllable poem)\n- ⟦{短歌|たんか}→短歌：15358_tanka⟧: tanka\n- {歌|うた}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{詠|よ}む→詠む：14186_yomu⟧: to compose a poem\n\nCOMPOUNDS:\n- ⟦{歌手|かしゅ}→歌手：00197_kashu⟧: singer\n- ⟦{歌詞|かし}→歌詞：13160_kashi⟧: lyrics\n- ⟦{国歌|こっか}→国歌：noentry⟧: national anthem\n- ⟦{子守|こもり}{歌|うた}→子守歌：19434_komoriuta⟧: lullaby\n- ⟦{民謡|みんよう}→民謡：07083_minyou⟧: folk song\n\nRELATED VERB:\n⟦{歌|うた}う→歌う：00684_utau⟧: to sing",
